  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">암석분류 한 후에 학교에 있는 암석 맞춰보기 하려고 하는데요. 세월의.흔적인지 잘 모르겠는 암석이 있어서요. 분류 부탁드립니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c531dbe587936907fff9b3262b3967c94f0e727c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c531dbe587936907fff9b3262b3967c94f0e727c\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. 편암</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2592133c3042583c1b3fd9e16712cc61fb13d687\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2592133c3042583c1b3fd9e16712cc61fb13d687\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 편암</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cf9b14185adf4073256115af618942f6041bf30\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cf9b14185adf4073256115af618942f6041bf30\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 편마암</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a630c7ed6b80687b5ec30faa5a719e186810db7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a630c7ed6b80687b5ec30faa5a719e186810db7\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">4. 석회암? 대리암?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=